WEBVTT

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.070
Hello!

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.570
Good work on your exams!

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:22.030
You've got three days off from tomorrow until commencement!

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.980
What should we do tomorrow?

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.950
Let's go out if the weather's nice.

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:30.250
How about that—

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.790
As I was saying!

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.640
Breaks after exams are a vital time to review! You can't simply wander all over!

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:46.080
So have a good excuse ready for if we run into each other, okay?

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.200
Teacher...

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.500
Huh, I woke up before my alarm went off.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.870
Wow, the weather's great today!

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:57.490
It feels so nice out I may as well get up early.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:13.210
Morning, Nazuna!

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:15.710
Aren't you ready yet?

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:19.480
Hurry up and change! We need to get going!

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.010
I'm glad it's so sunny.

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:28.810
Yeah!

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:29.930
Um...

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:33.060
Where are we going, anyway?

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:39.480
Yuno! Why didn't you tell her!?

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:42.650
I thought you were gonna!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:46.450
I probably should've asked...

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.660
Don't worry, you'll see.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.340
Sorry, Nazuna.

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:58.750
Sorry.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.440
Don't worry about it!

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.590
Welcome to the Open-Air Museum!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:06.130
I thought it'd be nice to come here after exams.

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:07.970
Oh, really?

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:12.510
Just thinking about my grades makes me feel like this.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:14.850
Oh, Rodin's "The Thinker"?

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:17.730
Yeah, that's it!

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.730
For me it's more "see no evil, hear no evil, speak no evil"

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:23.780
Oh, escapism?

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.570
Yuno...

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:29.330
And this is an explosion?

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:35.370
I think this is the path.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.880
Let's look at the outdoor exhibits first.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.420
Yeah. It feels so great out here.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.920
It's almost like we're on a picnic!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:46.050
But we're just on break after exams.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.890
We need to pay attention and study.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.300
I'm so glad I don't have to carry anything around!

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:53.520
Miya... Study...

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:57.060
Sorry to make you carry my purse.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:00.820
Oh, don't worry about it. I'd be lost without my bag anyway.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:04.200
Yuno, you passed yours off too?

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:07.200
Ye... yeah.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.490
Wow, that statue's so energetic!

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:15.140
They look like they're having a lot of fun.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:18.750
Even I get the theme!

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.340
Yunocchi, Yunocchi! Let's try it!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:24.300
You're mimicking the statue?

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.840
You look just like it!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:31.720
Hiro! Sae! You two do the next one of a duo!

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:40.440
I... I can't do it...

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:47.700
This one's called "White Awakening."

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:52.330
Sometimes modern art is tough to get.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:59.830
What do you think it should be called, Nazuna?

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.650
Well, umm...

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:04.160
Broken Bones?

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.130
Well, she's right...

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:12.790
I wonder what that one's called?

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:12.850
Why don't we all guess?

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.560
Erect, maybe?

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.440
Shaft?

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.310
Message from Space!

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:24.690
Man-made among Nature?

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.030
Smooth?

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.280
How about To a Harmonious World?

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.840
Let's just go with Nori's idea, okay?

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.960
No objections!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:47.210
This is the last outdoor statue installation.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:50.090
Even I could make something like this!

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:53.250
Why don't we go see the exhibits inside?

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.850
Yeah!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:02.260
So artists like you look at these and wonder what you would have made?

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:04.610
Yeah, a bit.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:05.740
Yeah.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:11.280
I wanna make something that's like peering at the sky through a kaleidoscope.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:14.240
Oh, how romantic! That'd be wonderful!

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:20.450
Or maybe one called Gulliver's Rice! A huge—

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:23.250
Fine, fine. Once we're done with the exhibits.

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:31.040
The air conditioning is great.

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.840
It feels completely different in here.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:41.920
It really has that museum atmosphere now.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:45.730
I like how dignified it feels.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:53.950
It's like I'm in a different country, even...

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:07.630
I wonder if anyone from our school will have this much of an impact on the world of art.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:13.800
It may not be any of my business, but I think you have that potential, Sae.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:19.720
Really? I guess.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:21.850
I think you do too, Hiro.

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:26.600
Yeah. I think everyone does.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:32.070
Huh, everyone's backing off.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:34.780
Maybe they feel something.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:45.580
So, which did you guys like best?

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.530
It's tough to rank them.

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:51.920
Statues, pictures, they had everything.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:55.290
I wanna make something when I get home!

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:59.970
Yeah. I feel like just making something, it doesn't matter what.

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:08.980
Wow! I mean, I was amazed by everything I saw, but it all felt so distant...

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:12.610
Really? Didn't you just make this?

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.490
Yeah...

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.490
Did you make that out of your chopsticks wrapper?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:23.370
That's a work of art too. Art is more connected to you than you think, Professor Nazuna.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.910
Whatcha up to, Yunocchi?

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.630
You're done eating, right, Miya?

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.840
Title: "Puberty!"

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:41.930
Or something.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:44.480
Because it's unstable?

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:56.870
Visiting the Open-Air Museum was a lot of fun.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:10:02.530
I'll be able to tell Ms. Yoshinoya that I used my time off well, too.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:06.250
I'm glad we all went together.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:11.890
Title: "What Makes Me Beautiful Tomorrow."

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:13.170
Or something.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:16.550
Oh, right! I need to put you in, too!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.760
It still needs something more...

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:26.770
A signature!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.210
This weather's great!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:53.840
It's so hot out...

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:55.880
Good morning.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:59.000
Good morning, Sae. It's hot out, isn't it?

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.840
We're studying at 11 today, right?

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:10.720
Wow, it's hot.

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.140
I can barely even stand keeping my clothes on.

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:16.360
It's an indoor pool, so it should be fine.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:19.360
You're all so excited.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:23.110
Have fun! See you tonight?

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:24.360
Yeah!

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:26.160
Let's go!

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:36.630
It's all tucked in back there, right?

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:40.410
Yeah, you got it all.

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:42.250
All right, I'm ready!

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:44.550
Don't you wear goggles, Miya?

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:47.260
Eek, that's cold!

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:50.680
You've got your locker key tied on tight, right?

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.190
Yeah!

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:55.300
And you remembered your goggles, right?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.190
Yeah!

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:59.690
All right, let's go!

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:01.200
A whistle!?

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:05.110
You're practicing for the swim meet, right?

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:08.200
Well, Miya is, but...

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:14.040
I just came because you invited me. I'm terrible at swimming.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:18.590
Nazuna, don't you want to join in? Yuno?

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:21.720
I'm not good at swimming either.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:25.220
Not good?

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:29.430
I, well, can't float.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:34.520
So I thought I'd practice by myself!

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.050
Sparkle sparkle sparkle.

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:37.900
Oh, I see.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:40.610
What's wrong, Nazuna?

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:48.950
Swimsuits like these really show off a lot of your figure...

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:52.240
Staaaaaaaare.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:56.240
Please! Don't look!

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:59.250
Hey, Nazuna, your underwear's poking out.

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:08.010
Wow, it's packed.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.760
It's always like that during summer vacation.

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:13.100
I wonder if she'll even have room to practice.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:18.510
This is the lane I want to practice on. I'll be fine.

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:23.390
Oh? You've been here before, haven't you?

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:25.520
Yeah. Yuno and I came, uhh...

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:26.740
Last year! That's it!

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:34.240
Here's your kickboard, Yunocchi!

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:37.590
Thanks! Wait, why did you bring two?

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:39.130
I'm gonna use this one.

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:45.630
You're using one too?

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:48.390
Sometimes I just feel like surfing.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.590
You're gonna stand on it?

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:51.350
Yeah.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:03.470
Well, that didn't work.

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.820
Look! Yunocchi's floating!

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:11.120
Sorry, Yunocchi!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:14.490
I'm really sorry! But you floated!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.040
Huh?

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.250
What happened?

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:24.760
See, Yunocchi, you can do it! You float when you're out cold!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.760
Doesn't everyone?

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:32.770
Well, for me, I can't float when I'm tense.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:35.010
Relax... Relax...

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:38.520
I can float tensed up!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.150
Miyako!?

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:43.360
Looking at that makes my jaw hurt...

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:48.540
I'm going to go swim over there.

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:50.160
Me too!

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:52.570
Sure! Good luck practicing!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:54.490
You too, Yuno!

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:55.490
Yeah.

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:16.060
Oh, wow!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:19.880
I wanna try a quickle turn too!

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:23.150
That sounds like something you'd clean with.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:29.400
We will now take a 10-minute break.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.910
Everyone, please leave the pool.

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:42.760
Nazuna!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:48.420
Oh, Nori! I think I'm going to go to the restroom now.

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:53.860
So, do you think she'll take it all off?

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:56.010
Nori...

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:01.280
The pool has reopened.

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.110
All right, back to work!

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:03.900
Right!

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:04.790
Yeah!

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.620
Nori?

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.460
Hey, Miya.

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:13.160
Can I join in?

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:17.960
I don't think I have enough time left in summer vacation, but...

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:22.010
I want to practice for the swim meet!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:25.790
Oh, wow, Yuno! Keep trying, I'm sure you can make the whole class proud!

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:28.300
Thanks, Miya!

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:31.100
And if that doesn't work out, you can always try Goishi-hiroi instead!

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:39.030
What shall we do?

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:41.980
You can go practice over there.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.690
Let's go. Together.

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:48.330
I don't think I can keep up with the current.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:50.820
Here's fine, then.

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.790
I've been swimming all day, anyway.

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:54.200
Let's do something!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.990
Really? Um...

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.750
How about we talk?

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:04.270
Can't we do that when we get back home?

00:17:08.930 --> 00:17:13.520
Miya! I think I've got it!

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:14.590
Got it!

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:16.940
Just kinda floaty...

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:17.970
Floaty like this?

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:19.430
Floaty like that!

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:22.400
Let me try it myself.

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:25.700
Floaty... Floaty...

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:37.490
I floated! I just floated!

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.740
Great job, Yunocchi!

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:44.000
Try stretching out your arms and legs now, Yuno.

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:46.250
Stretching out...

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:53.490
How was that?

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:58.340
Now try moving your arms and legs and going forward.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:17:59.260
Okay!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.310
Oh, I can hear the cicadas.

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.650
Summer's almost over.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.990
It's still plenty hot.

00:18:22.610 --> 00:18:23.950
Oh, it's from Hiro.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:27.080
"Let's finally do that pajama party tonight."

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:33.000
Thanks, Hiro. We'll be over later.

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:35.710
Okay!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:48.770
This is the last one, Hiro.

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:52.650
Thanks, Miya and Yuno!

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:54.400
Sorry we were so abrupt.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:55.630
Don't worry about it.

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:58.190
That's it!

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:02.360
Sorry we kept you waiting! We'll go get changed right away!

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:04.200
You can take your time.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:10.910
Well, then! Welcome to the pajama party!

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:17.010
Your pajamas are so cute, Nazuna!

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:19.550
Thanks!

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:25.430
I wonder why this feels like such a big deal? We all live in the same building anyway.

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:28.170
Do you do this a lot?

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:34.230
We just thought it'd be fun to get together for a sleepover.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.280
Yeah!

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:35.730
Yeah.

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:41.490
Today was so much fun!

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.200
All that practice must have worn you out.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:46.830
Did you all get a lot done?

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:50.450
Yeah! We ended up swimming until it got dark!

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:52.540
Well, I mean, we took breaks.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.590
I must've swam a hundred kilometers!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:58.460
That's enough to cross an ocean.

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:06.680
I just played around. It's the first time in ages I've been in a heated pool.

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:10.680
How'd Yuno do?

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:12.940
She really improved!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:17.020
She's not a hammer anymore, she's a mallet!

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.530
Floaty'n'...

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.030
Floaty?

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:26.530
Yeah! She learned to float today!

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:31.540
Wait, she's conked out!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:34.510
She must be worn out from trying so hard.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:39.470
But we can't have the person who came up with the party dozing off, can we?

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:42.380
It was Yuno's idea?

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:46.570
Yeah. She realized we'd never had a sleepover.

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:48.650
She must have been looking forward to it for a long time.

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:54.990
Aww, I thought we were all gonna chill out. I even brought my sketchbook.

00:20:54.990 --> 00:20:58.080
Why don't the rest of us do some sketching?

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:01.150
I can't draw at all!

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.400
Um...

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:06.480
Can I suggest a subject?

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:30.100
I fell asleep...

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:36.770
I wonder how late everyone else stayed up?

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:40.500
I wanted to stay up and chat too...

00:21:43.520 --> 00:21:45.820
They must have drawn together.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:53.350
Is this... Me!?

00:21:55.010 --> 00:21:58.290
Aww, It's so nice that they all drew me.

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:01.030
Huh?

00:23:40.190 --> 00:23:44.040
When I was little, I used to make Mom mad by blowing into my straw.

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:44.850
Because of the noise it made?

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:46.910
If you do it with milk, it makes white bubbles.

00:23:46.910 --> 00:23:48.880
Can't you just do that with soapy water?

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:52.030
Man, I just feel so satisfied today.

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:53.130
And what kind of bubbles would that be?

00:23:53.130 --> 00:23:54.560
Bubble tummy!

00:23:54.560 --> 00:23:56.510
Stuffed full of warm food!

00:23:56.510 --> 00:23:57.800
Yeah!

00:23:57.800 --> 00:24:04.990
Hidamari Sketch specials "May 9th Zabuzabuzazaa!" and "May 25th Welcome to the Village of Meat".

00:24:04.990 --> 00:24:08.740
We'll be waiting at Hidamari Apartments. Be sure to come see us!
